<title>USA: IPO FILING - Osiris Therapeutics.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Osiris Therapeutics.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		  Osiris Therapeutics Inc</p>
<p>  Estimated price range		  $8.50 - $10.50</p>
<p>  Total shares to be offered		4,025,000</p>
<p>  Lead Underwriter    Smith Barney Inc and SBC Warburg Inc</p>
<p>Business:  The company is engaged in the research and development of therapeutic products for the regeneration of human connective tissues like bone marrow stroma, bone, cartilage, muscle, tendon, ligament and fat through the use of mesenchymal stem cells (&quot;MSCs&quot;).</p>
<p>Osiris was founded in December, 1992, and is based in Baltimore, Maryland. Osiris expects to use the proceeds from the offering primarily to fund research and development.</p>
</text>
